  ($g221$cmp_ex14_8$g221$, $g222$gap$g222$, $g223$intermediate$g223$, $g224${"id":"cmp_ex14_8","level":"intermediate","group":14,"instruction":"Put the adjectives in brackets into the comparative or superlative form, adding any necessary words. (Dear Anita)","prompt":"In the end, I bought ______ (small) item of all.","answers":["the smallest"],"explanation":"Of all → the smallest."}$g224$, 27),
