  ($g241$cmp_ex15_1$g241$, $g242$gap$g242$, $g243$intermediate$g243$, $g244${"id":"cmp_ex15_1","level":"intermediate","group":15,"instruction":"Write the correct form of the comparative or superlative and complete the sentences with your own ideas.","prompt":"In my opinion, the tiger is ______ (dangerous) animal of all.","answers":["the most dangerous"],"explanation":"Of all → the most dangerous."}$g244$, 32),
